<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 https://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd">
    <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>
    <groupId>com.esp</groupId>
    <artifactId>esp-web-common</artifactId>
    <version>1.0.0</version>
    <name>esp-web-common</name>
    <packaging>jar</packaging>
    <description>
        ESP 共用 Web 能力包(engineering-ironrules 铁律一:公共能力共享包优先,收编 3 服务重复实现):
        1) GlobalExceptionHandler —— 统一错误 envelope {code,message,traceId},包范围由属性
           esp.web.common.base-packages 控制(逗号分隔),actuator 端点天然白名单;
           RestClientException -> 503,兜底 Exception -> 500,不泄漏内部堆栈。
        2) ApiError —— envelope 单一真源类型(替代各服务内联 Map.of)。
        3) TraceIdUtil.currentTraceId() —— OTel 当前 span traceId,未注入 agent 时返回 null。
        4) AppLogClient —— 结构化业务日志异步写 app_logs(独立线程池 + 降级不阻断业务),
           service 名由 esp.web.common.app-log.service 属性化,DB 连接默认走当前写库 JdbcTemplate,
           可通过 esp.web.common.app-log.jdbc-template-name 指定命名 bean(learning 用 sharedJdbcTemplate)。
        供 bff-java / learning-java / teacher-java 等所有 Java 服务复用,消除 handler/ 与 common/ 重复。
    </description>

    <properties>
        <maven.compiler.source>21</maven.compiler.source>
        <maven.compiler.target>21</maven.compiler.target>
        <project.build.sourceEncoding>UTF-8</project.build.sourceEncoding>
        <spring-boot.version>4.0.7</spring-boot.version>
        <spring.version>7.0.8</spring.version>
        <opentelemetry.version>1.55.0</opentelemetry.version>
        <jackson.version>2.21.6</jackson.version>
        <jakarta-servlet.version>6.1.0</jakarta-servlet.version>
    </properties>

    <dependencyManagement>
        <dependencies>
            <!-- Spring Boot BOM:统一各 spring-boot 依赖版本 -->
            <dependency>
                <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
                <artifactId>spring-boot-dependencies</artifactId>
                <version>${spring-boot.version}</version>
                <type>pom</type>
                <scope>import</scope>
            </dependency>
        </dependencies>
    </dependencyManagement>

    <dependencies>
        <!-- ===== Web MVC(provided:使用方自带 spring-boot-starter-web)=
             spring-webmvc 提供 @RestControllerAdvice / HandlerMethod;spring-web 提供 RestClientException -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-webmvc</artifactId>
            <version>${spring.version}</version>
            <scope>provided</scope>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-web</artifactId>
            <version>${spring.version}</version>
            <scope>provided</scope>
        </dependency>
        <!-- spring-context:@Configuration / @Bean / Environment -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-context</artifactId>
            <version>${spring.version}</version>
            <scope>provided</scope>
        </dependency>
        <!-- spring-jdbc:AppLogClient 的 JdbcTemplate(使用方 spring-boot-starter-jdbc/data-jpa 自带) -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-jdbc</artifactId>
            <version>${spring.version}</version>
            <scope>provided</scope>
        </dependency>
        <!-- spring-boot-autoconfigure:@AutoConfiguration / @ConditionalOn* / @EnableConfigurationProperties -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-boot-autoconfigure</artifactId>
            <version>${spring-boot.version}</version>
            <scope>provided</scope>
        </dependency>
        <!-- jakarta.servlet-api:HttpServletRequest(SB 使用方自带) -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>jakarta.servlet</groupId>
            <artifactId>jakarta.servlet-api</artifactId>
            <version>${jakarta-servlet.version}</version>
            <scope>provided</scope>
        </dependency>
        <!-- OpenTelemetry API:Span.current 取 traceId(javaagent 运行时注入,编译期需 API jar,同 bff 模式)。
             opentelemetry-api 的传递依赖 opentelemetry-context 在 provided scope 下不传递,需显式声明。 -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.opentelemetry</groupId>
            <artifactId>opentelemetry-api</artifactId>
            <version>${opentelemetry.version}</version>
            <scope>provided</scope>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.opentelemetry</groupId>
            <artifactId>opentelemetry-context</artifactId>
            <version>${opentelemetry.version}</version>
            <scope>provided</scope>
        </dependency>
        <!-- Jackson:AppLogClient payload 序列化(使用方 starter-web 自带) -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>com.fasterxml.jackson.core</groupId>
            <artifactId>jackson-databind</artifactId>
            <version>${jackson.version}</version>
            <scope>provided</scope>
        </dependency>
        <!-- SLF4J API:日志 -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.slf4j</groupId>
            <artifactId>slf4j-api</artifactId>
            <version>2.0.18</version>
            <scope>provided</scope>
        </dependency>

        <!-- ===== test ===== -->
        <!-- spring-boot-starter-test:junit-jupiter / mockito / assertj / hamcrest / spring-test / json-path -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-test</artifactId>
            <version>${spring-boot.version}</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
        <!-- SB4 WebMvc 测试模块:@AutoConfigureMockMvc / MockMvc 基础设施 -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-webmvc-test</artifactId>
            <version>${spring-boot.version}</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
        <!-- starter-web + starter-jdbc + h2:集成测试验证 @AutoConfiguration 装配
             (Web MVC 上下文 + 缺省 H2 数据源 + JdbcTemplate) -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-web</artifactId>
            <version>${spring-boot.version}</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-jdbc</artifactId>
            <version>${spring-boot.version}</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>com.h2database</groupId>
            <artifactId>h2</artifactId>
            <version>2.3.232</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
        <!-- OpenTelemetry SDK:TraceIdUtilTest 构造真实 span(同 bff 单测模式) -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.opentelemetry</groupId>
            <artifactId>opentelemetry-sdk</artifactId>
            <version>${opentelemetry.version}</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.opentelemetry</groupId>
            <artifactId>opentelemetry-sdk-trace</artifactId>
            <version>${opentelemetry.version}</version>
            <scope>test</scope>
        </dependency>
    </dependencies>

    <build>
        <plugins>
            <plugin>
                <groupId>org.apache.maven.plugins</groupId>
                <artifactId>maven-surefire-plugin</artifactId>
                <version>3.2.5</version>
            </plugin>
            <plugin>
                <groupId>org.jacoco</groupId>
                <artifactId>jacoco-maven-plugin</artifactId>
                <version>0.8.12</version>
                <executions>
                    <execution>
                        <id>prepare-agent</id>
                        <goals><goal>prepare-agent</goal></goals>
                    </execution>
                    <execution>
                        <id>report</id>
                        <phase>test</phase>
                        <goals><goal>report</goal></goals>
                    </execution>
                </executions>
            </plugin>
        </plugins>
    </build>
</project>
